      <section class="ent-sec" aria-labelledby="looks-h">
        <h2 class="ent-eyebrow" id="looks-h">What it looks like</h2>
        <h3 class="ent-h">If your team uses Slack, you already know how to use it.</h3>
        <p class="ent-body">OpenShore is a desktop and phone app for your whole team, with channels, direct messages and threads. The difference is who’s in them: expert AI bots you @mention like a teammate, and anything they change waits for a person’s approval. Here, the RevOps bot fixes a commission that came up short, without anyone leaving the chat.</p>
